<Positioned left="1172" top="462"><Text fontSize="20" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">重合段：两线平行错开 3px（红在左、蓝在右），可分别追踪。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1170" top="506"><Text fontSize="22" color="#0B1220FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">分段步数（路线二）</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1172" top="538" width="336"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">(2,2) 入口 → (12,3) 结构剧场：13 步 / 26 m</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1172" top="566" width="336"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">(12,3) 结构剧场 → (12,13) 作品巡览：10 步 / 20 m</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1172" top="594" width="336"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">(12,13) 作品巡览 → (23,15) 出口：13 步 / 26 m</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1170" top="630"><Text fontSize="22" color="#0B1220FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">路线一格心序列（前 6 与后 5 格）</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1172" top="660" width="336"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">(2,2) → (3,2) → (4,2) → (5,2) → (6,2) → (7,2) → … → (23,11) → (23,12) → (23,13) → (23,14) → (23,15)</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1170" top="694"><Text fontSize="22" color="#0B1220FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">绕行与门洞</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1172" top="724" width="336"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">两条路线都只能穿过 floor.txt 中已有的门洞；门洞位置与宽度未做</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1172" top="750" width="336"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">任何扩大。墙格始终为灰色、可走格始终为白色，路线不覆盖格号。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1170" top="786"><Text fontSize="22" color="#0B1220FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">连通性检查</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1172" top="816" width="336"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">可走格 337 个，全部可从入口到达：是；不可达 0 个。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1172" top="844" width="336"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">四邻域校验：两路线每一步都是上下左右跨 1 格，无对角、无穿墙。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="40" top="938"><Text fontSize="22" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">坐标：格心以 (x,y) 表示，原点在左上角、x 向右、y 向下；(0,0) 是最左上可走格的格心。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="40" top="966"><Text fontSize="22" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">尺度：每格边长 2 米；路线一步 = 跨一格 = 2 米。</Text></Positioned>
